WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:02,640
Comrade Chen Zhuo

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:03,940
You are his first contact

3
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:05,420
What advice do you have about him?

4
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:06,780
Speak boldly without any worries

5
00:00:06,860 --> 00:00:09,750
Don't miss any details Chief

6
00:00:09,950 --> 00:00:11,070
According to Li Ce

7
00:00:11,150 --> 00:00:12,870
There seems to be an error in his system.

8
00:00:12,950 --> 00:00:14,150
There's always a bunch of random horses

9
00:00:14,230 --> 00:00:15,630
But is this the reason?

10
00:00:15,710 --> 00:00:17,230
Resulting in his tasks being beyond his capabilities

11
00:00:17,310 --> 00:00:18,310
This remains to be verified

12
00:00:18,390 --> 00:00:19,990
There is another point about him that I am more concerned about.

13
00:00:20,070 --> 00:00:21,150
When I first came into contact with

14
00:00:21,230 --> 00:00:22,150
he expressed concern

15
00:00:22,230 --> 00:00:23,750
Said he didn’t want to be locked up

16
00:00:23,830 --> 00:00:24,750
Just want to cooperate

17
00:00:25,030 --> 00:00:26,870
I think he has some misunderstandings about us

18
00:00:26,950 --> 00:00:27,990
deep in our hearts

19
00:00:28,070 --> 00:00:29,430
There is vigilance and suspicion

20
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:31,070
But he finally chose to believe us

21
00:00:31,310 --> 00:00:32,350
this is our luck

22
00:00:32,430 --> 00:00:34,350
I think it is also the luck of the Dragon Kingdom.

23
00:00:34,430 --> 00:00:35,830
We need to show our sincerity

24
00:00:35,910 --> 00:00:37,190
Can't miss this luck

25
00:00:37,270 --> 00:00:39,390
I can't lose his trust either, I think.

26
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:40,470
we can keep

27
00:00:40,550 --> 00:00:42,550
Create a comfortable distance for both parties

28
00:00:42,630 --> 00:00:44,950
It neither makes Li Ce feel afraid nor loses his freedom

29
00:00:45,030 --> 00:00:46,830
It can also protect him

30
00:00:47,190 --> 00:00:48,990
After all, Li Ce is one of our own.

31
00:00:49,070 --> 00:00:50,310
I tested him before

32
00:00:50,390 --> 00:00:52,910
He had deep feelings for the Dragon Kingdom when he handed me the USB flash drive.

33
00:00:52,990 --> 00:00:55,070
Nor did he put forward any conditions to prove that Li Ce was a

34
00:00:55,150 --> 00:00:56,190
famous young man

35
00:00:56,270 --> 00:00:57,710
He believes that we will not treat him badly

36
00:00:57,790 --> 00:00:58,870
Then we will do it

37
00:00:59,110 --> 00:01:00,550
Comrade Chen Zhuo's speech is very good

38
00:01:00,670 --> 00:01:02,870
I think it's very serious and pragmatic.

39
00:01:02,950 --> 00:01:04,470
A young man who just graduated from college

40
00:01:04,550 --> 00:01:06,350
Able to find Long'an Bureau under pressure

41
00:01:06,430 --> 00:01:07,550
It's not easy

42
00:01:07,630 --> 00:01:08,750
Not only for himself

43
00:01:08,830 --> 00:01:10,150
Won the opportunity to complete the task

44
00:01:10,230 --> 00:01:11,350
Also keep our work confidential

45
00:01:11,430 --> 00:01:12,550
Save a lot of energy

46
00:01:13,150 --> 00:01:15,430
Regarding Comrade Li Ce’s issue, we still need

47
00:01:15,510 --> 00:01:16,790
Have a brief meeting

48
00:01:16,870 --> 00:01:18,670
Comrade Wang Jianguo Comrade Chen Zhuo

49
00:01:18,750 --> 00:01:27,640
Please wait here. Uncle Chen, you won't be here if you wake up.

50
00:01:27,720 --> 00:01:28,680
Keep watch all night

51
00:01:30,230 --> 00:01:31,510
That thing you handed over

52
00:01:31,590 --> 00:01:32,550
Last night I got half of it

53
00:01:32,630 --> 00:01:34,470
Heaven has pierced that

54
00:01:34,550 --> 00:01:35,670
What did the superiors say?

55
00:01:36,290 --> 00:01:37,450
Technology is important

56
00:01:37,530 --> 00:01:38,770
Someone has already taken over

57
00:01:38,850 --> 00:01:40,210
I would like to take the lead personally

58
00:01:40,290 --> 00:01:41,370
But compared to technology

59
00:01:41,450 --> 00:01:42,730
The boss cares more about you

60
00:01:42,810 --> 00:01:44,770
About your handling opinions and follow-up arrangements

61
00:01:44,850 --> 00:01:47,570
It has just been officially decided. Do you want to hear it?
